    detail: 'UNDERWAY. Jury selection began July 20 before Judge William F. Sullivan; the court plans to seat an 18-juror panel (12 jurors plus 6 alternates). Opening statements are possible late this week. Attorneys have estimated four to six weeks of trial. She is presumed innocent unless and until a jury says otherwise.',
    src: 'https://www.cbsnews.com/boston/news/lindsay-clancy-duxbury-ma-murder-trial/',
