    when: 'Murder sentencing not yet scheduled',
    status: 'Convicted of first-degree murder on July 9, 2026, in the killing of his wife, Maya Millete. The murder sentence (an exposure of 25 years to life) has not been scheduled; it is expected late summer or fall.',
    note: 'The July 20, 2026 status hearing before Judge Enrique Camarena concerns the separate, bifurcated unregistered-assault-weapon charge — which Millete has opted to have tried to the bench — not the murder sentencing. A sentencing date may be announced at that hearing.',
    src: 'https://www.nbcsandiego.com/news/local/whats-ahead-for-convicted-murderer-larry-millete/4047565/',
    srcLabel: 'NBC 7 San Diego, court reporting (July 2026)',
    srcType: 'Court reporting',
    link: '/post/the-maya-millete-case-larry-milletes-no-body-murder-trial-explained/',
